Subject: [PATCH] w-0f3a17 probe: per-slot shortlist dump and the two
 measurement probes

NOT FOR PUSH. Carries #[cfg(test)] dump instrumentation, which the item
forbids on any pushed branch. Kept locally on
scratch/0f3a17-shortlist-probe in its own worktree and target dir so the
arithmetic in docs/work/items/w-0f3a17-shortlist-rule.md is reproducible.

Adds a shortlist_dump module recording, per span edge, the offered
candidate count, the full quality-descending order, each retained word's
index in the sorted shortlist, its admission index, and which of the six
selection passes kept it; plus two probe tests: real exact-mode clue words
checked against the shortlist, and the reachability_corpus alignments
slot by slot.  The --lib suite is 64 passed / 0 failed with the
instrumentation, so it is inert.
